{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X的人物动机和段落之间的因果衔接不如Y明确，尤其是为什么离开、为什么动摇、最后为什么决定继续往前走，Y交代得更完整。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的主线短句和重点加亮让人能迅速抓住每段发生了什么，感受又有具体的听觉、身体和心理描写，并通过到时出现与音乐进程对应，扫读和听感结合得更好。Y的优势是叙事完整，人物为什么这样想、前后为什么发生转变交代得更清楚，但长句加右侧大量碎词，在短时段里容易增加阅读负担，也削弱了感受与具体音乐时刻的对应。综合来看，我更愿意选择X，因为它更像是在听音乐的同时读懂音乐，而不是一边听音乐一边读一段人物故事。</escape>\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ddf196f6-7c75-4061-b273-fbb364008a19", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052054412694Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:21:40.535929+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f8526c6d11230095c9eec5712a4e740e190b7c77a50e7722a53470c62900f99a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700